<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Astra cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Astra cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley's analyst James McKean said he cut the rating of Astra AB to neutral from its prior rating of outperform.</p>
<p>-- Astra shares slipped 3/8 to 46-7/8 in early trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
